  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICLD - ITP Capacitating Women Councillors 2 - ITP Zimbabwe Specific 2</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ICLD -ITP Capacitating Women Councillors 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A higher degree of involvement of women in politics at local level through improving and strengthening the capacity of selected ITP candidates</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ICLD &#xe4;mnar forts&#xe4;tta med det nationella utbildningsprogrammet: Local Leaders Capacitating Women in Zimbabwe 2015-2018. Syftet med programmet &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka kvinnors politiska deltagande, s&#xe4;rskilt p&#xe5; lokal niv&#xe5;. Programmet riktar sig till valda kvinnliga politiker som har potential att driva f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndring men ocks&#xe5; agera som f&#xf6;rebilder i det politiska livet. ICLD f&#xf6;resl&#xe5;r 50 deltagare men ocks&#xe5; 20 manliga politiker. Den utv&#xe4;rdering som genomf&#xf6;rts visar att programmet har visat viktiga resultat och lagt grunden f&#xf6;r ett fortsatt expanderat program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to local Government sector with Zimbabwe specific ITP course  in partnership with ICDL, with the aim of promoting a higher degree   of involvement of women in local politics in Zimbabwe through         training workshops and exchange visits. Continuation of contribution  52120078</narrative>
  </description>
